widgets_values:
subject_definitions:
<Subject 1> is the person in <Image 1>. Face and hairstyle follow <Image 2> (front) and <Image 3> (profile); body and proportions follow <Image 4> (full body); wardrobe follows <Image 5>; art style follows <Image 6>; environment follows <Image 7>; lighting mood follows <Image 8>; key props follow <Image 9>. Identity comes ONLY from the pictures — never from the videos.

motion_director:
@Video 1 is the CAMERA reference: borrow only its camera moves, cuts and pacing — never its content.
@Video 2 is the BODY reference: reproduce its physical actions, effort and timing for <Subject 1>.
@Video 3 is the TRANSITION reference: structure scene changes and temporal flow after it.

audio_director:
@Audio 1 defines the voice of <Subject 1> (timbre, tone, emotion) and drives lip-sync.
@Audio 2 is the ambient sound bed. @Audio 3 accents music or effects.

shot_plan:
1 shot, continuous take; camera follows @Video 1 grammar; <Subject 1> performs the action of @Video 2 with coherent physics, stable identity and stable on-screen text.

global_rules:
- Second pass may change ONLY resolution / steps / scheduler / denoise (0.2-0.3; lip-sync shots <=0.3). Seed, prompt and reference order stay locked.
- 武戏提示词要点：动作分解为「起手-发力-收势」三拍，写明接触点与重量感，避免高速旋转/大位移叠变。
